# Design Tokens Starter (JSON)
(Extracted from .claude/skills/design-system/templates/design-tokens-starter.json)

Structure follows W3C Design Tokens Community Group alignment.

- Primitive: Raw values for colors, spacing, fontSize, radius, shadow, duration.
- Semantic: Purpose aliases (background, primary, muted, destructive).
- Component: Specific overrides for Button, Input, Card.
- Dark: Mode-specific semantic overrides.

